WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.890
They tried to steal from the school.

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:05.690
And so they have been punished.

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.610
Yeah... that makes sense.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.400
Did they get suspended?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.990
No. Detention.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.530
Detention?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.200
They will get a special lesson there.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.700
You broke the school rules.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:24.710
And so now you're going to
learn what it means to be

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.630
a proud student of our school.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.000
"Detention Room"

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.220
My servants are always hungry.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.060
"Episode 3: Uh-Oh! Detention!"

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.390
But don't worry.

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.350
This is a special world.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:09.810
They won't eat you.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:15.940
Instead, they'll just go in and out of
your ears and mouth, and other holes, too.

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:16.190
"Detention Room"

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.820
That's all.

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:21.030
I have a really bad feeling.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.950
Me, too!

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.790
Anyway, when you meet them,

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.040
be very, very nice.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.960
Especially you, Major Tanya
von Degurechaff. Please!

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:35.050
I know!

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.720
I'll make sure they get
extra punishment later!

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:41.100
Oh, these two are not saying
what the other thinks they're saying.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:45.180
What should we feed Chomusuke?

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.390
I was so worried!

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:50.020
What kind of punishment did you
get in detention, by the way?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.440
Was it the stuff that makes you
scream in pain? Or in ecstasy?

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.780
What's wrong, guys?

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.450
What's wrong? Answer me!

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.990
What happened to make you look like that?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:06.120
Detention... that wasn't detention...

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.910
The black demons come...

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.790
So many of them...

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.170
What are you talking about?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:14.080
Darkness?

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.130
What?

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.710
Aqua?

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.890
What's in your hair?

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:39.030
"Class 2"

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.530
Can't we save them?

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:45.780
If they're like that after just half a day,
they won't last in there!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:49.200
They're in there with
lots of black living things?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.660
That doesn't sound scary to me!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:52.540
No, no!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.590
Lots of little black demons
running all over your body!

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:57.800
Scary!

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:00.300
Yeah? I bet you're into that!

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:01.510
Hell no!

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:05.050
I don't want any little
black creatures on my body.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:05.890
Really?

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.760
What do we do?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.680
Let's give up.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.600
No! That's cruel!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.060
What do you want?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.150
There's nothing we can do.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.360
Hey, Subaru?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.400
Why don't we talk to Mr. Rerugen?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.600
Brilliant thinking, Emilia!

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:22.440
Thanks.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.890
Can you try?

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:27.660
Yeah. I don't know what
we can do, but I'll talk to him.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:28.990
"Teacher's Office"

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:34.160
So do you think you can
reduce their punishment?

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.720
Is something wrong?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.300
She's such a good girl!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.010
The exact opposite of that demon
that wears the skin of a little girl!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:50.180
If they perform some kind of good deed,

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.570
then there's a good chance
their punishment could be reduced.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.600
Good deed?

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.440
Yes.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.860
A good deed.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.790
I'll talk to the principal, too.

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.990
Thank you.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:08.950
Emilia is such an angel...

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.850
What?

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.500
Well?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:21.250
He says if they do some kind of good deed,
their punishment could be reduced.

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.630
Good deed?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.750
That's hard.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.260
A good deed? That's really simple!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.140
You're certainly confident, Megumin.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.770
It's science class next period, right?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.310
Yes, why?

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:40.520
You're not going to do
something bad, are you?

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:41.730
"Science Lab"

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:45.900
Okay, let's start the experrriment!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:50.570
Girl, what's wrong?

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.530
Nothing...

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.000
Any students who can use fire magic,

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.250
light your Bunsen burners.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:05:59.750
I'll do it.

00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:01.630
Fireball.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.130
Who should set the fire?

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.050
I'll ask the spirits--

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.760
Chomusuke breathed fire!

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.350
Chomusuke's a cat.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.720
Cats don't breathe fire.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.480
Now, let's do it.

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:20.790
O-Okay.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.820
My name is Megumin.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.280
--What are you doing?
--The greatest of the Crimson Demons,
and this school's lunch announcer!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.530
--Tanya.
--The greatest of the Crimson Demons,
and this school's lunch announcer!

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:32.910
--The greatest of the Crimson Demons,
and this school's lunch announcer!

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.740
--I understand your role as disciplinarian.
--The greatest of the Crimson Demons,
and this school's lunch announcer!

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:36.950
--But let them do what they want to.
--The greatest of the Crimson Demons,
and this school's lunch announcer!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.120
--But let them do what they want to.
--I call upon the vast power hidden within me

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:39.710
--They're trying their best to help the others.
--I call upon the vast power hidden within me

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.880
--They're trying their best to help the others.
--to grant salvation to all beings.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:47.170
--But if they cause problems,
they'll get detention, too--
--Yes, even the Demon King that rules the world bows

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:48.130
--Mr. Roswaal isn't doing anything?
--Yes, even the Demon King
that rules the world bows

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:50.880
--Mr. Roswaal isn't doing anything?
--before the might of my explosion magic.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.890
--So it seems.
--Crimson, guide me!

00:06:52.890 --> 00:06:54.640
--Right, Ram?
--Crimson, guide me!

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:55.350
--Mr. Roswaal is a wise man.
Of course he noticed.
--Crimson, guide me!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:59.600
--Mr. Roswaal is a wise man.
Of course he noticed.
--I call upon you to bless my explosion magic,

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.690
and grant it my thanks!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.730
For when you implore the explosion magic,

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.480
the explosion magic will answer!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.530
Megumin...

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.150
Unleash...

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.650
Explo...

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.030
...<i>sion</i>!

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:16.990
Oh?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.120
What is thisssss?

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.370
Sorry.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:22.620
We failed to light the burner.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.170
Oh, we failed?

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:26.380
Oops, looks like we failed.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:27.460
Right, Mr. Ros-<i>chi</i>?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.420
Yessssss.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.180
Well, everyone has bad daaaaays.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:38.720
But this is a bit much for an
ordinary faaailure, isn't it?

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:42.900
Oh my.

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:43.100
"Principal's Office"

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:47.070
Now what will those two do?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:49.530
What's wrong?

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.030
I hear a loud noise.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.200
Is that the sound of a flood?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.080
It seems to be approaching.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:58.160
Approaching the principal's office?

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.750
Most likely.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.870
What?

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.630
Now, your secret stash
of cigars is right here.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.250
Oh, no!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.930
You're here?

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.680
Good timing.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.180
We need your help.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.430
Principal!

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:22.560
If we can stop the flooding,
can we get out of detention?

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.690
Very well.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.850
Good deeds must be rewarded.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.610
Kazuma! Aqua!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.440
Right!

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:31.150
Leave it to me, horse-faced man!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.280
The name's Koenig...

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:32.860
"Principal's Office"

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.860
Neumann, Grantz! Deploy a barrier!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.490
Right!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.830
Yup!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:42.080
Kazuma, we'll seal the water
we've gathered in my shield!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.250
Okay!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.210
Now, Aqua!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.290
Leave it to me!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.050
Who do you think I am?

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.170
I'm the goddess of water!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.340
Okay, go! Goddess of party tricks!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.590
No!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:55.510
Fine!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:58.510
I'll show you why I'm the goddess of water.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.020
I thought she was just dumb.

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:03.520
But I guess her power is real?

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.440
Yeah.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:06.520
She's a goddess!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.360
Water control!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:12.070
That's basically a party trick!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.450
And so...

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.910
You're out of detention, huh?

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:29.040
I'm glad you all got to do a good deed.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.170
Megumin did a bad deed first, though.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:34.590
What are you talking about? No idea.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:36.630
--Come on!
--Anyway,

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.010
great work, guys.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:38.840
Thank you!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:42.600
Now don't break the rules anymore, okay?

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.480
Thanks, Megumin.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:48.310
You should thank your commander, not me.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:51.570
She didn't step in and stop us.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.320
Okay, you go thank her
on our behalf, Neumann.

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.740
Just me?

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.450
Not happening?

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:02.740
I'm glad it all worked out, Mr. Roswaal.

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:06.150
Oh, Mr. Kyouhukou!

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:10.790
As a result, the students
are closer than ever.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:12.670
Yes.

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:14.880
I hope it keeps going well.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.130
Indeed.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:19.680
Oh, care to join me for afternoon tea?

00:10:19.970 --> 00:11:50.787
I refuse.
